1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,580
A brave young warrior stands at the edge of a vast mountain
range, holding his sword and looking toward the distant
peaks.

2
00:00:07,580 --> 00:00:14,380
He begins his journey through the dense forest, carefully
navigating between tall trees and rocky paths.

3
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:21,500
The warrior discovers an ancient temple hidden deep in the
mountains, with stone pillars and mysterious carvings.

4
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:28,250
Inside the temple, he meets a wise old master who teaches
him the secrets of inner strength and courage.
